      "duration_s": 9,
      "year": 1952,
      "caption": {
        "en": "Decided in principle in 1945, the demolitions began in March 1952, where Sveavägen was to be extended south.",
        "sv": "Rivningarna, principbeslutade 1945, började i mars 1952 där Sveavägen skulle förlängas söderut."
